# User Personal Data & Logs
system/logs/
system/laporan/*/
*.log

# Keep sample template report
!system/contoh_laporan_perangkat.md

# Build Outputs & Temp Files
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user
*.suo
*.pdb
*.tmp

# IDE & Editor Settings
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Windows OS Files
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
